      "code": "ZVAL_COPY(&EG(user_error_handler), &(fci.function_name));",
      "note": "Registers the PoC's closure as `EG(user_error_handler)` and leaves its mask at `E_ALL`, creating the reentrant userland error-handling state that later frees `$a` during the deprecation warning.",
      "kind": "source"
